WEBVTT

00:00:57.621 --> 00:01:01.024
I was hungry and upset and tired,

00:01:01.058 --> 00:01:04.494
and I made that well known
by sprawling out in that back seat

00:01:04.528 --> 00:01:06.830
and whining just a little bit.

00:01:07.764 --> 00:01:09.633
I was only allowed one thing to eat.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:11.568
Green apple.

00:01:11.602 --> 00:01:13.537
Not a frosty,

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:15.105
a green apple.

00:01:16.206 --> 00:01:18.308
But honestly,

00:01:18.342 --> 00:01:22.646
as much as I would have killed
for that frosty,

00:01:22.646 --> 00:01:25.415
that frosty probably would have killed me.

00:01:27.117 --> 00:01:31.188
Now, I'm sure you won't be shocked
to find out that diabetes is expensive.